178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Resource allocation often requires selecting a valuable combination of objects while obeying a fixed limit. Examples include loading a vehicle, choosing projects under a budget, and packing equipment. The 0/1 Knapsack Problem is a standard mathematical model for this decision.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
